      "role": "user",
      "content": "i feel like im just a repeat of everything bad in my family. like, it’s just in my blood. the addiction, the anger, the way we all just ruin everything we touch. it’s like a cycle that never ends and i’m just... i'm just another broken link in the chain. honestly i feel like i’m just making it worse for everyone else by even being here.",
